      "markdownBody": "# CodeRabbit findings for PAN-4838 (PR #4962)\n\nCodeRabbit posted 2 inline finding(s). CodeRabbit is advisory: nothing waits for these,\nbut each one gets an answer, either a fix or a reply with your reason.\n\n- Thread 4461051500 · apps/mobile/ios/App/App/OverdeckKeysPlugin.swift:38 [Minor]: Copy an existing push key pair from the private group into the shared group.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/4962#discussion_r4461051500\n- Thread 4461051551 · apps/mobile/README.md:158 [Minor]: Mark cold-launch tap routing as unverified.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/4962#discussion_r4461051551\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Read each thread (open its link, or the code at the path and line).\n2. If you agree with a finding, fix it.\n3. If you reject a finding, reply on its thread with your reason:\n   `gh api repos/eltmon/overdeck/pulls/4962/comments/<thread id>/replies -f body=\"<reason>\"`\n4. If you changed code: run the quality gates on what you touched, commit, push, then run `pan review request PAN-4838`.\n   If you only replied, you are done.\n5. If PR #4962 has already merged when you read this, nothing more lands on it: open a follow-up issue\n   for the findings you agree with instead of pushing."
